WEBVTT

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.300
Everybody told me slow down, slow down

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.000
But my heart don’t know how

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:09.610
Turn it up

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.800
Till the walls start shaking

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.340
Turn it up, turn it up

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.360
Every street is waking

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.600
I don’t need a spotlight

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.360
I’m the spark tonight

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.900
I’m the spark, till the walls start shaking

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.100
I’m the spark
